    "details": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe theme of the webinar:\u003C/strong\u003E The Story - Motivational Session by a successful innovator.\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExpert Speaker:\u003C/strong\u003E Dr. Sanjiban Banerjee, Co-founder, and Director of AbGenics Lifesciences Private Ltd.\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDate of Webinar:\u003C/strong\u003E 16th December 2020 | \u003Cstrong\u003ETime:\u003C/strong\u003E 11:00 AM\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELink for the webinar:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ca href=\"https://meet.google.com/vme-moyi-wuv\" target=\"_blank\"\u003EJoin Here\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003EThis session will be conducted by Dr. Sanjiban Banerjee, Co-founder, and Director of AbGenics Lifesciences Private Ltd, a Pune-based biotech company working to develop antibody-based therapeutics for infectious diseases and cancer.\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003EHe will share his experience and lessons learned in his entrepreneurial journey in the search for novel antibacterial biologicals.\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003EThis is a great opportunity for students and young faculty members to understand the experiences and challenges faced by a successful entrepreneur. At the end of the session, participants will have the chance to directly interact with him to clear any doubts regarding opening a start-up company.\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe eagerly await your participation in the Webinar.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003ENote:\u003C/em\u003E This mail is also being forwarded to our server support team and Dr. Anirban Sarkar to circulate it to all students of NIT Durgapur.\u003C/p\u003E",
