    "details": "\u003C!DOCTYPE html\u003E\n\u003Chtml lang=\"en\"\u003E\n\u003Chead\u003E\n  \u003Cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003E\n  \u003Cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"\u003E\n  \u003Ctitle\u003ESeminar on Converting Innovation into a Start-up\u003C/title\u003E\n  \u003Cstyle\u003E\n    body {\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      margin: 20px;\n      background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .event-container {\n      background: #fff;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: auto;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      color: #2c3e50;\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      color: #34495e;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 8px 0;\n    }\n    ul {\n      margin: 10px 0 10px 20px;\n    }\n    strong {\n      color: #2c3e50;\n    }\n  \u003C/style\u003E\n\u003C/head\u003E\n\u003Cbody\u003E\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"event-container\"\u003E\n    \u003Ch1\u003ESeminar on Converting Innovation into a Start-up\u003C/h1\u003E\n\n    \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDate & Time:\u003C/strong\u003E 3rd August 2025, 5:30 PM – 6:00 PM\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEminent Speaker:\u003C/strong\u003E Prof. (Dr.) Geetika Goel, Former Dean (Resource Generation), MNNIT Allahabad\u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Ch2\u003EDescription\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp\u003E\n      The seminar focused on the theme of transforming innovative ideas into successful start-ups. \n      Prof. (Dr.) Geetika Goel shared valuable insights on the process of idea validation, resource management, \n      and strategies to navigate challenges in the entrepreneurial journey. The session provided participants \n      with exposure to practical approaches in converting academic and research innovations into viable business ventures.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Ch2\u003EObjective\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp\u003E\n      To inspire and guide students, researchers, and innovators in leveraging their ideas for entrepreneurial success, \n      equipping them with the mindset and knowledge to establish start-ups.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Ch2\u003EBenefits\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cul\u003E\n      \u003Cli\u003ELearn strategies to translate innovation into business opportunities.\u003C/li\u003E\n      \u003Cli\u003EGain insights from the experience of an eminent academic leader.\u003C/li\u003E\n      \u003Cli\u003EUnderstand resource generation and management for start-ups.\u003C/li\u003E\n      \u003Cli\u003EDevelop an entrepreneurial perspective to foster innovation-driven growth.\u003C/li\u003E\n    \u003C/ul\u003E\n  \u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/body\u003E\n\u003C/html\u003E",
